@overheard circles
// Writer 3, batch 2. The ship's little circles (facts.md 5), by speaker: who: is A, with: is B (dialogue 0.43.8).
// The knitting circle, the ladder club, the Halcyon twins, the fish keepers, the rainy-places club, the four
// lost-property boxes, the coffee machine fixers, the star journals, the herb growers, the headphones, the Kesh
// grandmothers, the Valo post bag, the playlists, the mystery swappers, the old Wren families, the telescopes, the
// tiny portraits, the breakfast jokers and the rest-day bakers. quirks.lines keeps the habit-based ones.

== overheard
? pair:any+any who:torres-zeke with:kovac-zainab|dahl-mira mem:moment.torres.scarf
A: It's for the new hand.
B: It's longer than the new hand.
A: They'll grow into it.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:kovac-zainab with:torres-zeke|dahl-mira
A: Your tension's off.
B: My tension's fine.
A: Your scarf disagrees.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:dahl-mira with:torres-zeke|kovac-zainab
A: Grey again. It goes with everything.
B: It goes with nothing. That's the same thing.

? pair:any+any who:torres-zeke with:kovac-zainab|dahl-mira
A: I've dropped a stitch.
B: Where?
A: Somewhere in the last metre.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi with:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi
A: Oh. You're on the ladder too.
B: For the exercise.
A: Yes. The exercise. Me too.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi with:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi
A: The lift's working again, you know.
B: I know.
A: After you, then.
B: No, no. After you.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi with:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi
A: Thirty-one rungs, Deck 4 to Deck 5.
B: You counted too?
A: I... no. Did you?   #funny

? pair:any+any who:navarro-mateo|salo-saad|nakamura-bilal with:navarro-mateo|salo-saad|nakamura-bilal
A: Heard from your twin?
B: Says the Halcyon's food is better.
A: Mine says that too. They're in it together.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:navarro-mateo|salo-saad|nakamura-bilal with:navarro-mateo|salo-saad|nakamura-bilal
A: The Halcyon crew call our three "the set".
B: The set of what?
A: Twins. Collect all three, apparently.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:grieve-thea with:walsh-esme|vasquez-uma|hart-ravi
A: Two's sulking, my sister says.
B: How can she tell?
A: He's facing the wall. Very pointedly.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:hart-ravi with:grieve-thea|walsh-esme|vasquez-uma
A: Nan drew my fish again.
B: Any good?
A: One of them has a hat now. I doubt it's accurate.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:vasquez-uma with:grieve-thea|walsh-esme|hart-ravi
A: Mum says my fish are in a mood.
B: All of them?
A: It's catching, apparently.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:walsh-esme with:grieve-thea|vasquez-uma|hart-ravi
A: My brother's overfeeding mine. I can tell.
B: From here?
A: From his letters. Too cheerful.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:dlamini-lukas|bakshi-sol|walsh-esme|santos-zofia with:dlamini-lukas|bakshi-sol|walsh-esme|santos-zofia
